WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:36.490
My name is Kurata Sana, first year middle school student.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.660
The amazing white bat Babbit.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.660
Don't forget to sort your garbage!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.450
Hayama Akito.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:47.460
Matsui Fuka, my Kansai-speaking best friend.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.380
It's not so bad that you have to cry, right?
A little thing like that...

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.550
Forget it!
Mind your own business!

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:56.880
Sana...

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.550
D-didn't I tell you not to call me by my given name?!

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:07.690
Enough... I don't know what to do anymore!

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:13.520
Somewhere There
Lies the Truth

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.280
I hit that jerk.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.860
So what... it was his fault anyway.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:24.950
How come no one understands what I'm feeling?

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.580
Well... I guess they don't know... cause I didn't say anything.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:36.960
An uncomfortable atmosphere at the burger shop.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.180
Sana-chan can run really fast!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.260
Absolutely no one can catch her.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:46.770
Right, right... I think the only one around who can catch her is probably Hayama-kun.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.270
Yeah, only Akito-kun.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.270
So we asked him to do us a favor...

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.980
...and run and catch her for us.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.980
They didn't actually ask him to do it but it was said to "save Fuka's face".

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.280
Are you two concerned for me?

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.150
No... Right?

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:03.280
Thanks guys.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.290
Well... where's Sana?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.670
I don't get it, she just ran off screaming.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.750
That looks painful...

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.670
Shh!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.960
We can all see that!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.760
What's with that girl?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.050
I find her even harder to understand than I did before.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:27.680
I'm such an idiot... believing someone else's gossip.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:32.770
From past experience, I should've known those were just other people's baseless rumors.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.570
But Sana-chan's situation is different...

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.780
...because it's printed in magazines.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.150
I'm such an idiot.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.700
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:47.740
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:47.790
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:47.830
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:47.870
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:47.910
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:47.950
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:47.990
We shouldn't be here

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:48.040
We shouldn't be here

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.080
What are you going to do?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.960
Now that we know they weren't dating...
Sana and Kamura Naozumi-kun.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.050
Well... Akito?

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.260
Why should I care about that?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.890
Nothing to do with me,
I'm dating you now.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.680
I would like to believe that...

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.350
...but because of your behavior...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.270
I can't really believe what you say.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.270
What are you talking about?

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.860
Last month you borrowed a cd...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.070
...every day you say "I'll give it back tomorrow", "I'll give it back tomorrow"...

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.780
...but you still haven't given it back to me yet...

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.780
So that's why.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.070
And even though you say we're dating...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.870
...we almost never have any time together...

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.660
...the only times are when you don't have to practice karate...

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.660
...and when we walk home from school together....

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.250
...and once in a while we meet at the convenience store...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.250
It's true that we've held hands...

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.960
...but whatever you're thinking, I have no idea.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.420
Wait there a minute!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.960
Why are you running away again?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.880
Jeez... I'm so confused about everything.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.470
In short, even after dating two months...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.690
I still don't know... what he's thinking...

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.980
We really don't know what his next step will be.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.360
Akito used to really like Sana.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.150
I knew that.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.080
But because of my crazy request for him to pretend to be my boyfriend...

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.590
I began to think he's a pretty nice person...

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:24.380
...and I started to like him a lot.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.890
Then more rumors surfaced about Sana and Naozumi-kun...

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.260
...and when the article came out saying that...

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.060
...they were a couple...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.060
...and made a big splash...

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.060
...he looked depressed...

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.060
...and very lonely.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.980
Was it a good thing to ask him to be my real boyfriend?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.570
Maybe in the beginning...

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.570
...I felt sorry for him so it was partly out of sympathy...

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.990
...but now...

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.370
My cd!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.500
What? No way! You just ran all the way home to get this?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.750
That was really fast!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.960
I squashed two people on the road.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.880
What?

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.090
You didn't think I could do it, right?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.670
Jeez...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:11.050
But now when I really think about it...
I really do like him.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.470
Let's go home. I'll walk you back...

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.060
...because I'm a gentleman!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.190
My home is that way.
When will you remember that?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.360
This isn't my 'hood.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.490
Even though Sana's back now...

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.280
...and even though she said the rumors were wrong...

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.870
...I guess I just have to trust Akito.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.170
So Sana came home crying?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.880
Yeah, she looked like she'd been crying...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.380
This is what they call youth!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:47.510
Juice of Youth

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.170
I don't understand why you're so moved?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.880
Isn't this nice? Isn't this nice?

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:49.880
Let her cry it out!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:55.180
When she needs us, she'll come to us!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.060
Everything's messed up inside my head...

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.980
Everyone believed the media...

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.190
...just like those idiots who hurt me.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.650
In the burger shop,
I felt strange, unlike myself.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:16.660
It's become very hard and painful to be among my friends or to be in school.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:19.580
Sana-chan.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.960
Please come in.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.380
It's about time, Sana-chan.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.380
Eh? What is it?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.170
The taping of the show... we haven't been there for a while.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.470
Ok, ok.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.970
Are you alright? Don't force it.
It's okay to rest, we can go another time.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:40.180
No! I have to work, work! When the head is confused, it's best to work!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:43.850
Young people in the labor force should be grateful for this chance to work hard!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.860
Work! Work! Let's work!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.150
Maeda-san!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.780
How are you?

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.160
Does that mean...
Naozumi-kun is here also?!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.870
Where? Where? Where? Where?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.280
He's getting ready in the dressing room.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.580
Naozumi-kun!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:58.290
Sana-chan!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.450
Naozumi-kun!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.670
Naozumi-kun's body isn't bad.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.590
Sana-chan, is something wrong?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.670
Listen up! Listen up, Naozumi-kun!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.550
Something unbelievable!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.550
Sana-chan, don't you care that I'm changing?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.050
Why is it like this?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.560
This probably came from being burned?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.980
Now you've seen it.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.060
At that time...

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.520
At that moment,
everything seemed so hazy.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:34.740
I see now, you protected me by blocking all the flying sparks.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.870
Don't move.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.090
Why is this so dense?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.380
Naozumi-kun really gives me nothing but unconditional tenderness.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.670
Is unconditional like this?

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:55.890
Just like what the rumors say...

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.760
...maybe I should be together with Naozumi-kun...

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.560
Sana-chan, this doesn't look too good.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.350
If anyone see this...

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.850
...I don't know what they'll say next...

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.980
I don't care what they write.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.270
Let's go where we should be going.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.860
Go?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.360
You mean we should be going to Heaven in my dream?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.660
Sana-chan, get a grip. Wake up!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.450
Is this Heaven?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.790
What is it?
Something happened in school?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.040
Yeah...

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.170
What is it? Let's hear it.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.880
But if I tell you this type of stuff, you'll think I'm brainless.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.470
I already knew you were brainless before today.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.180
It's okay, why don't you just tell me?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.010
Brainless

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.890
You can count knowing you're brainless as a step forward!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.260
Thanks for telling me straight.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.350
The king's ear, the donkey's ear.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:48.690
I see, so everyone believed the media.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:52.150
Yeah, even my friends believed it.
That's what makes it such a shock.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.360
Our relationship...

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.490
...being misunderstood...

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.660
...and Hayama-kun getting a girlfriend...

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.790
Which happened first?

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.660
What are you talking about?

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.080
Ah? Never mind!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.960
Just like before, still so slow when it comes to this stuff.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.090
Sana-chan, it's about time.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.970
Okay.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.050
Sorry I kept you by talking about strange stuff like this.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.470
But after I unloaded to you I feel better!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.180
Later!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:27.770
But now my mind feels heavier than before.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.860
Now that Sana-chan's back she has to take the "final exam".

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.660
This slide is designed to slowly decline every time it hears a lie.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.280
So the first question...

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.040
When you were shooting on location,

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.580
did you think about missing your handsome teacher Zenjiro at least one hundred times?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.080
Yes!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.090
I'm sorry! I didn't think about it once!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.750
Not even once?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:55.380
Right!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.090
The second question...

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.680
Like those rumors about you and Kamura Naozumi-kun...

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:03.970
You also want to have a similar rumor with your handsome teacher Zenjiro, right?

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.680
Yes!

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:09.190
I'm sorry, if a rumor like that got out, it'd be the insult of a lifetime!

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.480
You've turned bad.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.360
Why? Why?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.360
Question three,

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:22.360
If you shoot another movie, would you want to be cast as a couple with your teacher Zenjiro?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:23.660
Yes!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.450
It's impossible to act together!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.160
Make up your mind!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.250
Sana-chan! Welcome back!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:41.680
Cool! This was a really complicated welcome, you guys have moved me! Thank you!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.180
That was pretty good before. Sana-chan's jokes haven't changed from before.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.180
I wasn't joking!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.860
This week's Sana-chan.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.490
I'm so happy!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.860
I knew working would be more fun!

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.780
Yeah, Sana-chan's expressions were really good!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.450
You looked relaxed.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.160
Really?

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:14.670
Would I really feel that life would be good if it involved nothing but work?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.250
I'm home!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.670
Welcome back!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.670
The show just started, Kamura-kun's on!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.970
Really?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.890
I saw him at the tv studio today...

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:26.970
...wearing the same clothes.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:31.350
...and, working together with Kurata Sana-chan, there must have been a lot of talk?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.480
Again? Why these type of questions again?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.480
That's pretty obvious...
everyone's interested in it.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.070
...but that was very annoying...

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.070
...since everyone really believed it.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.780
The truth is only I like her.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.990
Well... Really?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.950
Yeah, and I was totally rejected.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.450
Do you think it's a good idea to say this out loud?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.870
"Butt" rhymes with "stock". Sana is trying to say "stock" but says "butt".

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.870
No, don't say anything, Naozumi-kun! If you say this, it'll affect your "butt"!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.880
You mean his "certificate"??!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.880
But she really should be saying "certificate" meaning it affects how others view his character.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.380
"Butt" is over here!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.260
Sana-chan already has someone she likes.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.180
Sana! Get out of the way!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:08.970
You can't say it! Can't say it! No way!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.350
This phone has not been turned on.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.770
Damn it, Naozumi! Connect me now!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.730
But... I can give you a little hint.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:26.360
He came jogging by on that morning to see her off before we went on location.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.370
So that sums up...

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.580
...my relationship with Sana-chan...

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:34.660
...at work we're very good partners.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.090
Do you know what "uoy evol i" means?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.050
{parte b}

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.970
It means "I love you"!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:53.350
Hey! Cut! Cut! I wanna cut this part!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.180
But this is a live broadcast...

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.560
And it's being broadcast nationwide!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.060
We'll lose our cover.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.360
Even if no one else knows... he will.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.860
Hayama is going to find out that I like him.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:07.990
Rei-kun!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.950
I need to see Naozumi-kun!
I have to see him!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.870
Please don't move around so much!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.120
Go to Naozumi's apartment
on the double!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.090
Welcome!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.470
This is your first time here, right?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:31.970
Maeda-san, I finally have a girl to see me at night!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.060
I see, you've grown up then!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.980
Stop joking around now!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.980
Wow, what a vicious woman!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.280
This is just juice!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.860
Naozumi-kun, you don't mind that they talk about your emotions this way?

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.280
Of course I mind.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.580
Then why did you spill it?

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:05.590
You dumped me so quickly and easily.

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:10.470
Did you think I had no feelings?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:23.770
Anyway, I think of this as just a little joke...
you can forgive me, right?

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.780
But... but he's already got a girlfriend!

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:29.150
...and I don't want him to know my feelings!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:32.870
And I told you before...
she's my friend too!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.870
Naozumi-kun didn't consider her feelings at all!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.960
But I don't know her at all...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:46.380
...and I think, Sana-chan, you need to know your situation better...

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.670
What?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.470
You know that Hayama-kun likes you too?

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:59.060
No way...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:03.690
At least... he liked you before we left for the location shoot.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.490
You don't know what you're talking about.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.360
See, you don't know anything!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.370
How... how would you know, Naozumi-kun?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.660
I think everyone knows but you!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.080
That's a lie!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.580
I won't believe it unless he tells me so himself!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.590
So why don't you go ask him?

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:33.380
So this is your true face, Naozumi-kun?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.890
Naozumi-kun's...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.350
...enough...

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.280
I'm never speaking to you again!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.870
She won't ever speak to you again.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.620
I feel for you. You...

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.590
I'm just doing this for your own good.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.380
Maybe someday, you'll understand...

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.770
Naozumi-kun, you stupid moron!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.570
Hey, Nao, you'll catch the flu that way.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.190
Rei-kun... I wanna take a sick day from school.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.770
Wanna go home?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.980
But you'll have to go to war with sensei!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.150
Rest rest rest!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.150
If you don't go to work, you've gotta go to school!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.580
I wished we could go somewhere instantly, like that Heaven place.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.200
Ummm... school... or Heaven... let's just go to school.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:29.210
Besides, not everyone watched the show on TV yesterday!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.460
Mind your own business...

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:35.380
Right... besides
I've met Hayama-kun before...

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.470
...he doesn't talk much.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.260
And no one knows anyway.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:43.180
So it'll be okay as long as you don't run into him, right?

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.850
That's right... you're right.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:55.070
As long as I don't run into Hayama I'll be fine... and his classroom is far away.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.280
Good morning, Sana!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.780
G-good morning!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.160
What a surprise for you to come in so early.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.160
Yeah.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.950
Hey Fuka, what did you do last night... around 10 o'clock?

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:08.580
Last night? I was watching videos that my mom rented! Some story on this little pig.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.080
Ah, really.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.380
That's great, that's great... at least Fuka didn't see it.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:20.760
Group gym period

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.430
A failure at jumping 5 levels!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:27.850
Hey Sana-chan! Last night on TV Kamura-kun said something about you!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.690
Yeah, Naozumi-kun said you dumped him, is that true?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.350
Right, and he said you like someone else, is that true?

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.690
And who was it that saw you off when you went on the location shoot?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.650
That... ummm...

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:40.070
Sana, really there's someone you like?

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:40.860
That's right!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.570
Who is it? Who is it?

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.280
I'm hearing this for the first time...

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.080
Who can it be?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:52.460
Nah... don't believe everything you hear from people in entertainment!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:56.090
You can't believe all these rumors!

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.090
I think we all knew that.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.050
But who's the guy?

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:05.180
Let's not dwell on this!
I'm gonna take gym seriously!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.180
Sana-chan, here comes the ball!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.190
- Are you okay, Sana?
- Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.560
Ah, they look like little carrots!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.570
Yeah, you should visit the nurse.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.980
Yeah, I'll go.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.650
I'll go with you too...

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.660
That's okay, it's alright...
so everyone, I gotta go!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:26.370
This is great, I can sneak out this way.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.080
Alright, you'll be fine.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.370
Thank you very much!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.170
What's wrong? You don't feel well?

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:39.250
Yeah, I feel some pain.
Can I rest here a while?

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.590
Of course you can!
Why don't you lay down there?

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:45.050
Someone is sleeping on the bed next to yours, so be quiet while you're here.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.180
Okay... fantastic!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.480
Now I can be away from everyone else...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.860
Oh no, I woke him up...

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.360
What... what's wrong?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:07.370
I didn't sleep all day yesterday...

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.280
...then I fell from my chair in class...

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:11.660
He isn't fully awake yet...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.160
I see! Then I won't bother you...

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.880
Sensei, I think I'm okay now...

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.460
Thanks for your help!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.960
Wait! I wanna give you some medicine...

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.970
No need! Thanks!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.260
Oh my god! That was close!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.690
That hurts! Who put that there?

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:40.150
That was me! I'm so sorry!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.360
No, wait... let go of me!

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:46.780
I said don't!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:57.080
Yesterday on TV...
Kamura said some strange things...

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:04.090
...I thought he was just talking nonsense at the time...

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:09.680
...but I still want to know what the truth is...

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:15.560
I don't know what's going on.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:18.190
Tell me the truth!

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:23.480
I have to hear it from you...
I'll only believe you!

